<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TRINOVA Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TRINOVA Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it upgraded TRINOVA Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Said in a report that February sales for company's industrial group rose in the U.S. while European sales declined modestly.</p>
<p>-- Said February orders rose about 10 percent versus February 1996 and were also up double digits versus January.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed up 1/8 to 37-1/8 in New York Stock Exchange trading.</p>
</text>
